                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 3,
                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Let\u2019s take care of our elderly!\n\nAll four of my grandparents lived at our house when I was growing up. Three were very sick. I helped take care them.\n\nMy mom and dad lived until they were 93 and 95. \n\nHealthcare, hospitals and growing old can be complicated and I am devoted to help our elderly.\n\nToday, I helped cut the ribbon at @NorthwellHealth Age-Friendly Center of Excellence in Oyster Bay supported by the Glen Cove Hospital\u2019s Geriatric Center for Excellence.\n\nThis vital facility, supported by a $2 million federal grant I secured in 2022, brings together a dedicated team to deliver comprehensive, one-stop healthcare for our aging population. My hope is that it, along with the work at the Glen Cove Hospital\u2019s Geriatric Center for Excellence, will become a national model to help our seniors age as healthy as possible.",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": null,
                "text_tagged_users_ids": null,
                "text_tags": null,
