                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "This is #NationalNursesWeek\n\nMy Mom was an RN and worked in the operating room at Glen Cove Hospital. The skilled care and emotional support that nurses provide to patients and their families is unrivaled and deserves our recognition.\n\nTo the more than 4 million registered nurses in the US working in hospitals, skilled nursing facilities, physician offices, community health centers, schools, home health, hospice, or outpatient settings, and the millions more that came before them, including my Mom, thank you for all that you do and continue to do!",
