                "text": "29% of the children in my district count on Medicaid. These proposed cuts would crush our neighbors, hospitals, and health care providers. Listen to these interviews and decide whether unnecessary tax cuts for the wealthiest Americans and massive deficits are worth the cost. https://t.co/ybsUV15Md9",
